## Verification Reference

### Verification Objective

Demonstrate that the Adaptive Vehicle Intelligence Architecture provides adaptive vehicle intelligence in accordance with the Objective Statement.

---

### Verification Method

Verification of this objective shall be achieved through a combination of:

| Method | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| Analysis | Demonstrate that the architecture supports adaptive vehicle intelligence. |
| Demonstration | Show that the integrated system exhibits the required adaptive capabilities. |
| Test | Confirm that the system performs the required adaptive functions under defined conditions. |

---

### Verification Reference

Detailed verification procedures shall be maintained within the AVIA Verification domain and referenced from this objective upon approval.

---

### Verification Success Criteria

Verification shall demonstrate that the system can:

- Perceive relevant environmental information.
- Interpret operational context.
- Generate adaptive decisions.
- Support execution of approved actions.
- Maintain adaptive behavior within defined engineering constraints.

